@startuml
title RocketMQ 本地缓存失效广播交互

actor Admin as Admin
participant "MatchupPayAdmi" as Producer
queue "RocketMQ" as MQ
participant "MatchupPayHub" as Consumer
participant "LocalCacheComponent" as Cache

Admin -> Producer: 配置/数据变更
Producer -> Producer: 构建 Message\n{cacheName, keyString, action}
Producer -> MQ: send(topic:tag, payload JSON)

MQ --> Consumer: 广播消息（BROADCASTING）
Consumer -> Consumer: 反序列化消息
alt action == EVICT
  Consumer -> Cache: evict(cacheName, keyString)
else action == CLEAR
  Consumer -> Cache: clear(cacheName)
end
Cache --> Consumer: 本地缓存已更新
Consumer --> Admin: 可选：记录日志/告警

@enduml